sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant API as GenerationService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Redis/BullMQ
  participant WK as AI Worker
  participant AI as AI Service (FastAPI)
  P->>API: POST /stories/:id/generate
  API->>DB: load owned story, check not custom, AI not blocked
  API->>API: assertNoLeftoverNames (real names must be tokens)
  API->>DB: BEGIN, UPDATE stories SET status=generating WHERE status!=generating
  alt 0 rows
    API-->>P: 409 Story is being generated
  end
  API->>DB: insert ai_requests(queued), holdCredit (FOR UPDATE wallet)
  alt insufficient credit
    API-->>P: 402 rollback
  end
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API->>Q: add(story_text, ai_request_id)
  alt enqueue fails
    API->>DB: finalizeFailure -> releaseCredit, story back to draft
    API-->>P: 503 credit refunded
  end
  API-->>P: 202 {aiRequestId}
  Q->>WK: job
  WK->>DB: markProcessing (queued -> processing)
  WK->>AI: POST /v1/story/generate (template slots + {NVx} tokens only)
  AI-->>WK: pages, scenes, checkpoints (JSON)
  WK->>DB: persistAiResult: write pages/checkpoints, story ready, consumeCredit
  P->>API: GET /stories/:id/generation (poll)
  API-->>P: status succeeded / failed + message
